OL,3,GNEWSA'We're sick of lorry drivers using
OL,4,Aour street as a toilet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have raised concerns about lorry
OL,7,Fdrivers illegally parking overnight
OL,8,Fnear their homes and using a street as
OL,9,Fa toilet.
OL,11,FKerstin Chinery said she once counted
OL,12,F21 HGVs on double-yellow lines in Carr
OL,13,FRoad, Felixstowe, Suffolk, and often
OL,14,Ffound bags and bottles of human waste
OL,15,Fwhile picking litter with her
OL,16,Fsix-year-old daughter.
OL,18,F"If a child runs over a bag, they've
OL,19,Fgot faeces and urine trodden into their
OL,20,Fschool shoes," she said.
