OL,3,GNEWSA'We're sick of lorry drivers using
OL,4,Aour street as a toilet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshton Cull from the Road Haulage
OL,7,FAssociation said he sympathised with
OL,8,Fresidents but called for more places
OL,9,Ffor HGV drivers to stop.
